# ==============================================================================
# CAN Bus-Off Trigger & Recovery Test Fixtures
# ==============================================================================
# Wire layout: [id_b3][id_b2][id_b1][id_b0][dlc][data...]
# Simulates cumulative transmit error count (TEC) escalation to bus-off (TEC > 255)
# followed by controller reset and recovery sequences.

# 1. Normal frame (TEC = 0)
00000100081027721F7F82AA55

# 2. Bit error event frame (TEC += 8 -> 8)
2000000100

# 3. Form error frame (TEC += 8 -> 16)
2000000200

# 4. Stuff error frame (TEC += 8 -> 24)
2000000400

# 5. Consecutive ACK error sequence crossing warning limit (TEC > 96)
2000002008FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF

# 6. CRC error frame entering error passive state (TEC > 127)
2000000808A5A5A5A5A5A5A5A5

# 7. Heavy bus contention error frame triggering bus-off (TEC > 255)
20000040080000000000000000

# 8. Bus-off active state indicator (ERR_STATE_BUS_OFF)
2000008000

# 9. Controller reset initiation (EVT_MANUAL_RESET)
2000010000

# 10. Bus idle 128 occurrences of 11 consecutive recessive bits (EVT_RESET_COMPLETE)
2000020000
